 "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczek5.jpg"}, {"id": 1651830, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczek6.jpg"}], "slug": "collector-10-lives-challenge", "summary": "Only 10 lives. 90 handcrafted levels. One brutal challenge.\n\nCollector: 10 Lives Challenge is a distilled arcade-puzzle experience built entirely around mastery and survival. You start with just 10 lives \u2014 and that\u2019s all you\u2019ll ever get. Lose them all, and it\u2019s back to the very beginning. No extra continues. No shortcuts. Just pure challenge.\n\nYour goal is simple: guide a small crystal orb along intricate paths and collect every gold piece in each level. The moment all gold is collected, the level ends. But one wrong click, one mistimed jump, and you\u2019re out. With every mistake, your precious pool of lives shrinks. Can you survive all 90 levels in a single run?", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/collector-10-lives-challenge", "videos": [{"id": 163410, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "04X6kU2EBnM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=04X6kU2EBnM", "title": "Collector", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/04X6kU2EBnM/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}